    "description": "Hurl a flask of bottled flame at a target square. All units on that square and directly adjacent to that square are dealt 2d12 Fire damage and 2 Brk damage. On a successful Agi saving throw (DC 8 + caster Tqn), affected units only take 1d12 Fire damage and no Brk damage.<br><br><div style=\"\">The tiles caught in the explosion are set aflame for 1 turn. These squares count as Difficult Terrain (2 Mov cost) and inflict 5 Fire Dmg to units who end their phase on them. They additionally emit 1 sq radius of light.<br></div>",
